the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Alter of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    Zulassung des Antrags holds for *a case*.
    Volljährigkeit nachgewiesen holds for *a case*.
    Antragsteller volljährig holds for *a case*.
    Ausnahmetatbestand holds for *a case*.
    Volljährigkeit nachgewiesen would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Antragsteller volljährig is judged to hold for *a case*; open textured.
    Ausnahmetatbestand would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_3_node_capabilities includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/node-capabilities.ruml".

Zulassung des Antrags holds for a case if
    Volljährigkeit nachgewiesen holds for the case
    and Antragsteller volljährig holds for the case
    and Ausnahmetatbestand holds for the case.

Volljährigkeit nachgewiesen holds for a case if
    the Alter of the case is a number N
    and N >= 18.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Volljährigkeit nachgewiesen holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Alter of the case is a number
    and Volljährigkeit nachgewiesen would hold for the case.

Antragsteller volljährig holds for a case if
    the Alter of the case is a number N
    and N >= 18.

Antragsteller volljährig holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Alter of the case is a number
    and Antragsteller volljährig is judged to hold for the case.

Ausnahmetatbestand holds for a case if
    the Alter of the case is a number N
    and N >= 18.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Ausnahmetatbestand holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Alter of the case is a number
    and Ausnahmetatbestand would hold for the case.

